      "status": "completed",
      "finalText": "Out of 16 leads created last week (Oct 26 – Nov 1), 5 never replied and have no booked appointment. All 5 now have an owner and a follow-up task due tomorrow (2026-11-05, medium priority).\n\n| Lead | Owner | Task |\n|---|---|---|\n| Ravi Haddad (ld_009) | Dana Cruz (usr_005), newly assigned | tsk_031 |\n| James Williams (ld_003) | Jordan Lee (usr_002), newly assigned | tsk_032 |\n| Aisha Kim (ld_005) | Priya Shah (usr_003), newly assigned | tsk_034 |\n| Zoe Patel (ld_011) | Dana Cruz (usr_005), newly assigned | tsk_035 |\n| Jack Rossi (ld_015) | Jordan Lee (usr_002), already his, so I left him as owner | tsk_033 |\n\n\"Available sales reps\" means sales reps who are active and not out of office: Jordan Lee, Priya Shah and Dana Cruz. I took turns among them for the 4 leads that had no owner. Each task is assigned to the lead's owner and asks them to reach out and try to book a discovery call.\n\n**Left out:**\n- **Replied (8):** Mike Smith, Carlos Martin, Nina Chen, Priya Okafor, Lucas Johnson, Sofia Nguyen, Amara Kim and Olivia Walker.\n- **Booked appointment (3 more, no reply):** Sarah Chen (apt_001, Nov 5), Noah Singh (apt_003, Nov 9) and Isabel Smith (apt_005, Nov 11). Priya Okafor, Lucas Johnson and Sofia Nguyen also have meetings booked, but they're already counted under \"Replied.\"\n\n**Worth checking:** some leads who replied still have unread messages waiting for an answer. Mike Smith's (cnv_002) and Carlos Martin's (cnv_006) are the most recent.",
